","id":"不完备性定理的计算意义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"相继式演算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/proof-theory/sequent-calculus"},"next":{"title":"构造性逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/mathematical-logic/proof-theory/constructive-logic"}}